"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>E</mi></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>. After the allotted oracle calls, the\noutput must satisfy <span class=\"math display\" data-tex=\"\\[f(\\bar{x})-f(x^\\star)\\leq\\varepsilon\n\\quad P\\text{-a.s.}\\]\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" display=\"true\"><mjx-math display=\"true\" style=\"margin-left: 0; margin-right: 0;\" class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mover><mjx-over style=\"padding-bottom: 0.105em; padding-left: 0.314em; margin-bottom: -0.544em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" style=\"width: 0; margin-left: -0.25em;\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-cAF\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-over><mjx-base><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-base></mjx-mover></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2212\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"3\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D453 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c28\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-msup><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D465 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-script style=\"vertical-align: 0.413em;\"><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" size=\"s\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c22C6\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo></mjx-script></mjx-msup><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c29\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mo class=\"mjx-n\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2264\"></mjx-c></mjx-mo><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\" space=\"4\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D700 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mstyle><mjx-mspace style=\"width: 1em;\"></mjx-mspace></mjx-mstyle><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-i\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D443 TEX-I\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi><mjx-mtext class=\"mjx-n\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2D\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c61\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c73\"></mjx-c><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c2E\"></mjx-c></mjx-mtext></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mover><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">¯</mo></mover></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>−</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msup><mi>x</mi><mo>⋆</mo></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>ε</mi><mstyle scriptlevel=\"0\"><mspace width=\"1em\"></mspace></mstyle><mi>P</mi><mtext>-a.s.</mtext></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span></p>\n", "theorems": [], "comparisonHtml": null, "source": "import Mathlib.Analysis.Calculus.Gradient.Basic\nimport Mathlib.Analysis.Convex.Function\nimport Mathlib.Algebra.Order.Floor.Ring\nimport LongTails.Template\n\nnamespace LongTails.Setups.SmoothAndConvexUnknownL\n\nopen OracleTemplate\n\nstructure Public where\n  E : Type u\n  [normedE : NormedAddCommGroup E]\n  [linearE : InnerProductSpace ℝ E]\n  [completeE : CompleteSpace E]\n  x0 : E\n\nattribute [instance] Public.normedE Public.linearE Public.completeE\n\nstructure Params extends Public where\n  L : ℝ\n  R : ℝ\n  ε : ℝ\n\nabbrev spec : Setup where\n  Params := Params\n  Public := Public\n  Instance p := p.E → ℝ\n  Query p := p.E\n  Reply p := p.E\n  Output p := p.E\n  publicInput := Params.toPublic\n  valid q := 0 < q.L ∧ 0 ≤ q.R ∧ 0 < q.ε\n  admissible q f oracle :=\n    ConvexOn ℝ Set.univ f ∧\n    (∀ k seed x, HasGradientAt f (oracle.answer k (0, x) seed) x) ∧\n    (∀ k seed x y, ‖oracle.answer k (0, x) seed - oracle.answer k (0, y) seed‖ ≤ q.L * ‖x - y‖) ∧\n    (∃ xstar, IsMinOn f Set.univ xstar ∧ ‖q.x0 - xstar‖ ≤ q.R)\n  successful q f output P :=\n    ∃ xstar, IsMinOn f Set.univ xstar ∧\n      ∀ᵐ ω ∂(P : MeasureTheory.Measure _), f (output ω) - f xstar ≤ q.ε\n\nend LongTails.Setups.SmoothAndConvexUnknownL\n", "url": "setups/SmoothAndConvexUnknownL/"}